      "text": "[7:24PM] #LekkiPeninsula #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from Lekki Roundabout to Lekki Peninsula Gate, Fam City, Road 12, Admiralty Roundabout, dow to Dome/Freedom Way, and Itedo.\n\nBusy traffic from VFS to Ikate Gate due to traffic light alternation at Ikate Roundabout.\n\nSmooth return journey from Ikate Gate to VFS, via Car Wash, Dome/Freedom Way, UBA/Admiralty Road down to Lekki Peninsula Gate, and Lekki Roundabout.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
