      "text": "[8:22PM] #AirportRd #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from Oshodi Express to Apakun, Nacho, and International Airport Road.\nSmooth traffic flow on Airport Road to Ajao Estate Gate, Fatai Irawo Junction, Awoniyi Elemo Junction, Lateef Salami Street, Asa Afariogun Street, Eleganza Roundabout, Chivita stretch, and Canoe to NNPC Junction.\nGood return journey from NNPC to Canoe, Chivita, Lookman Atobajehun Swimming Pool, Hollandia Way, Ajibade Babatola, Kolawole Shonibare Street, Eleganza Roundabout, and Asa Afariogun Street.\nUnimpeded movement from Aye Junction to Oswani Roundabout via Aswani Market.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
